Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Friendship Rekindled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 55
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.63,0:00:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The energy shield is about to close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.07,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s rush through while we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.15,0:00:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone’s here; it’s time to spring the trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.61,0:01:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear, swat them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.98,0:01:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The one responsible for destroying everyone’s world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.18,0:01:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.82,0:01:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.38,0:01:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so beautiful here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:01:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.66,0:01:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the garden in the painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:01:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the world of Pink’s dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.23,0:02:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The device is over there. Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you pests come from? Trying to eat my flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink, it’s me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.22,0:02:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.10,0:02:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,get out of here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Trespassing on my manor—unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink, didn’t we agree
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.41,0:02:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,to save your world together?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.53,0:03:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This {\i1}is{\i0} my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t these Colorful Dandelions your favorite?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why destroy them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Because, being here…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,even if shattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,they can gather together again
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.98,0:03:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and be reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s hurry to the Absorption Device.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.87,0:03:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is leaving this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys go—I’ll hold her off here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can’t leave you behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.26,0:04:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, I’ll come find you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, it’s a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.01,0:04:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the underground city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,my new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.71,0:04:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.23,0:04:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The robots here have all been taken over by Peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.43,0:04:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.06,0:05:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll cover you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.50,0:05:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.73,0:05:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:05:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Got any other tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.52,0:06:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends will definitely stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like your friends won’t be making it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.16,0:06:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Give back Sparky,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.31,0:06:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and Tibbie—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough said. That’s what happens to anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.19,0:06:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,who tries to stop our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.19,0:06:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it’s your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.94,0:06:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.30,0:07:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we’re here to stop you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.74,0:07:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s great that you’re all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised you I would come find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.07,0:07:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you manage to break free from Blue’s control?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Brown, come to your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.77,0:07:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! We aren’t enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who intrudes on my world is an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink, take a good look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,These flowers were all stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.03,0:08:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.10,0:08:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you’ve got?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.98,0:08:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mere child’s play.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.22,0:08:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you say I was your second friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends don’t hurt friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Second friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Brown, have you forgotten the promise you made to Brother Dahuang
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.98,0:08:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,to protect your village?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren’t you trying to restore the garden of your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.01,0:09:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink, their home and their roots don’t belong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.97,0:09:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is certainly not the world of your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The dandelions are so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.61,0:09:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so beautiful here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.85,0:09:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is their true home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please remember—Brother Dahuang is waiting for you to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.97,0:10:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Brown, don’t forget the promise we made.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.56,0:10:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The delicious food we shared, the scenery we admired together…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.03,0:10:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,are all proof of our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.23,0:10:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.15,0:10:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Pink! Thank goodness, you’re awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.11,0:10:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, come to your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You traitors who’ve turned against your own kind…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being so deluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.16,0:10:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They will definitely help you break free from Blue’s control.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will absolutely not be swayed by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.99,0:11:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, have you forgotten
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,what you’ve always stood for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.27,0:11:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re supposed to save your original world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.91,0:11:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what we said inside the black hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t give up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.22,0:11:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I, my friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and everyone in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If we all join forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.97,0:11:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,we can definitely save this colorful world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.70,0:11:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A colorful world…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, try to remember, Peach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.99,0:11:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a little more time; I can save this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.22,0:11:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Peach.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
